{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "main_8_level_main_08-15_beg",
  "groupId": "main_8",
  "stageId": "main_08-15",
  "title": "恨火，流向原野",
  "storyCode": "JT8-1",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_08-15_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "51b3333c01dc4884c1fb33c135540ab75f717fa8dfef6b8454ff5ec0ac150b24",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者戰士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_080",
      "text": "這裡就是了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者戰士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_080",
      "text": "......塔露拉......你可以不管這件事的，這台感染者牽引車失蹤已經幾個月了，可能就是被糾察隊截住了而已，我們沒什麼可做的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "即使是找到遺體，也是給其他人的交代。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者戰士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_080",
      "text": "要是偵察員沒弄錯的話，他們失蹤的地方，大概就是在這附近。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者戰士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_080",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者戰士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_080",
      "text": "塔露拉！別想了。別想那些胡說八道了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "我沒有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者戰士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_080",
      "text": "這些沒心沒肺的傢伙......別管他們！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者戰士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_080",
      "text": "他們根本就沒有走下去、走出雪原的決心！和你一起打過仗，怎麼會不知道你才是最不怕死的那個？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者戰士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_080",
      "text": "塔露拉，相信我，我們都是願意追隨你的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者戰士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_080",
      "text": "博卓卡斯替大尉不也是烏薩斯帝國的軍人嗎？但大家都知道他才是我們最堅定的戰士！所有人都信他！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "可不一定。只是因為他太強，太堅固了，那些不相信的人還不敢這麼說。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "信任的崩塌只是一瞬間的事情。如果有一天，相信愛國者的人都死了，那麼後來人還會不會像他原來的追隨者那樣堅定？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "流言會摧毀他人。在沒有流言蜚語之前，清白的人是清白的，將信將疑的人也是清白的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "流言出現以後，就沒有人是清白的了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者戰士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_080",
      "text": "可是，可是你出身怎麼樣又有什麼關係？！你為他們流了多少血？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "沒事的。別著急。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "而且我還沒來得及為他們流多少血。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者戰士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_080",
      "text": "哎......不要這麼說。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者戰士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_080",
      "text": "你確定要一個人去？浮士德最近已經跟在一些用弓弩的人身邊了，他成長得很快，遊擊隊不在，你也可以和他們一起去......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "保護其他同行的感染者才是最重要的。我們不是為了打仗而去打仗，我們到頭來就是想讓其他同胞能夠活下去。不能本末倒置。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "他們的命才是最重要的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "一定要把這個想法一直傳遞下去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者戰士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_080",
      "text": "那你......保重。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "放心吧。只是要和當地人交涉而已，不會有什麼問題的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "附近的小村落"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "要是以前的我，一定就徑直走進去問了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "從什麼時候開始變成現在這樣子？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "東躲西藏，偷偷摸摸......不信任和提防已經逐漸演化成敵意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "我是在害怕意外發生，還是在害怕悲劇重演......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "貧瘠的村子。似乎今年的收成也不好。人人臉上都掛著疲倦的神情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "奇怪，這村子應該很久沒有遷移了，村口卻能看到多處牽引車刮擦的痕跡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "裝配處的廢材料......應該不是村子廢棄的舊牽引車。驗證盒不見了。如果是村子自己的車，沒必要拿走驗證盒......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "快入夜了。去垃圾場看看會好一些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "不對勁。除了日常垃圾以外，沒再看到任何垃圾殘餘了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "處理耗盡源石的儀器一台也沒見到。不放在垃圾場，會放到哪裡去了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "本來在入冬後隨處可見的麥稈殘渣和暖草草殼也沒了。糧食出了問題嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "......不對......不對。是一起燒掉了。有必要去糧倉看看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "怎麼回事？怎麼......怎麼回事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "沉積的源石碎屑......刨得坑坑窪窪的地面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "啊，抓痕，糧倉門上的抓痕——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "啊——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "幹什麼的？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "塔露拉回過身。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "看見塔露拉的穿著，烏薩斯農民放下了手中的鐵鏟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏薩斯農民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_081",
      "text": "老爺......您這是怎麼了？怎麼進村子都不說一聲？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏薩斯農民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_081",
      "text": "老爺來這是做什麼的？以前從沒見過您......是憲兵嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏薩斯農民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_081",
      "text": "還是說，您是來收租的？我們的源石稅和糧食，全給徵稅官啦！拿不出什麼東西了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "我是來調查一些感染者的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏薩斯農民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_081",
      "text": "啊。感染者？我們村子裡是沒有感染者的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "那有感染者路過這裡嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏薩斯農民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_081",
      "text": "沒有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "我們接到過訊息。的確有感染者從這裡路過。識相點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏薩斯農民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_081",
      "text": "啊，老爺，瞞不住您！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏薩斯農民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_081",
      "text": "這些混帳東西，明明說過沒任何人知道他們從這走的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "所以說的確有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏薩斯農民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_081",
      "text": "是的，他們各個都拿著可怕的武器，可嚇人了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏薩斯農民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_081",
      "text": "我們不敢反抗他們，也沒敢攔他們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏薩斯農民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_081",
      "text": "之後他們還搶了我們的糧食。可惡啊，太可恨了，老爺，你一定得抓到這些為非作歹的感染者啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "不對。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "不對......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "不！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "你們怎麼敢這麼說？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "你們怎麼敢這麼說......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "你們怎麼敢這麼說！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏薩斯農民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_081",
      "text": "啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏薩斯農民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_081",
      "text": "老爺......？您怎麼了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "你聽見他們哭喊了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "你聽見他們喊救命......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "你聽得見他們手指刮刨倉庫大門的聲音！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏薩斯農民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_081",
      "text": "怎，怎麼......老爺......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏薩斯農民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_081",
      "text": "你沒中邪吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏薩斯農民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_081",
      "text": "喂，你們快過來！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏薩斯農民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_081",
      "text": "你們見過她嗎？她是哪裡的人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏薩斯農民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_081",
      "text": "對，我沒聽過她的口音！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏薩斯農民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_081",
      "text": "......是啊！她沒帶防護面具......調查感染者的官員怎麼可能不戴護具？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏薩斯農民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_081",
      "text": "你到底是誰？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏薩斯農民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_081",
      "text": "問你話呢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "感染者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏薩斯農民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_081",
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "我和被你們害死的那些人一樣，是感染者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏薩斯農民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_081",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏薩斯農民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_081",
      "text": "我們沒做錯什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "你把他們關在這裡。你讓他們困死在這。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏薩斯農民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_081",
      "text": "我有什麼辦法？我們也一點糧食都沒有了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "你可以趕走他們。你可以不讓他們進村......哪怕你直接攻擊他們，殺了他們，我都不會多說一個字。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "但你們欺騙他們，讓他們待在空無一物的倉庫裡，鎖上大門，活活餓死他們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "他們餓得連法術都用不了......他們乞求般地來到這裡。他們不想攻擊你們，沒有反抗的力氣，他們只是些普通人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏薩斯農民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_081",
      "text": "感染者是什麼普通人？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏薩斯農民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_081",
      "text": "聽好了，你這個感染了的死爛樣子......你也懂道理！你知道自己是個怎麼樣的怪胎對吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "你們封閉倉庫，直到源石結晶穩定下來，將他們的屍體和各種乾涸源石一起處理了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "他們有家人，有親人，有想去的地方......他們屍骨無存。感染者是經常屍骨無存，可現在，連他們的灰燼飄向何方，我們都沒法再知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏薩斯農民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_081",
      "text": "我們有什麼辦法？我們也沒吃沒喝，我們也過得很慘！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "你們為什麼要騙他們？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏薩斯農民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_081",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏薩斯農民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_081",
      "text": "你在說什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏薩斯農民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_081",
      "text": "誰知道感染者會怎麼樣？我們又能怎麼辦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "藉口。你看見他們餓成那樣......你看見他們手無寸鐵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "你這麼做僅僅是因為這麼做......很方便。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "你們從一開始就......不。哈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "即使來到這裡的不是感染者是普通人，你們也會做一樣的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏薩斯農民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_081",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏薩斯農民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_081",
      "text": "（得把她處理了。去叫哨兵！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "不。不。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏薩斯農民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_081",
      "text": "那你想做什麼？事情都發生了，對不起，感染者老爺。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏薩斯農民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_081",
      "text": "不過我們也可以當你沒來過，就像當之前那些人沒來過一樣......你只要走就行了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "你們當他們是什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏薩斯農民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_081",
      "text": "啊？你是什麼，他們就是什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "你們當他們是弱者，那我就是不知如何反抗的弱者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏薩斯農民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_081",
      "text": "......呃......感染者老爺！行行好，我們只是不想惹事！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "那他們求你的時候，你們是什麼反應？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "不。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "我憎恨你們這些卑劣的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "只要你們還活在這片大地上，這片大地就永無寧日。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "感染者糾察官已經三年沒來過你們的村子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "擁有這幾個聚落的貴族早在大叛亂中喪生，局勢混亂不堪，你們的村子已經多年無人管理。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "就在這樣的情況下......你們......自然而然地......害死了和你們毫無利害關係的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "只要你們心存一點點善意......你們一樣可以放走他們。整個村子聽著他們的哀嚎無動於衷，直到他們死去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "但凡還有一丁點善意存在，你們就不會如此惡毒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "text": "我恨你們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "不！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
